Package: mayonodulepexa
Title: Mayo Clinic Solitary Pulmonary Nodule Model - ModelsCloud Service
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Stephen J.", "Swensen", role = "ctb",
           comment = "First author of the Mayo Clinic model"))
Description: Implements the Mayo Clinic model for the probability that a
    solitary, radiologically indeterminate pulmonary nodule is malignant
    (Swensen et al., Archives of Internal Medicine 1997
    <doi:10.1001/archinte.1997.00440290031002>), using the equation as
    published in Schultz et al., Thorax 2008 <doi:10.1136/thx.2007.084731>.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
